      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 79701,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765046989866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To start, could you please provide your name and order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765046991866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure. It's Mark Peterson. The order number is... hold on... VF88602.",
